OL,3,GNEWSANew Speaker wants to make sure
OL,4,AMHKs 'have a voice'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnsuring members of the House of Keys
OL,7,F"have a voice" is an important part of
OL,8,Fbeing the presiding officer, the
OL,9,Fnewly-selected speaker has said.
OL,11,FDavid Ashford was voted into the role
OL,12,Fat a special sitting on Tuesday
OL,13,Ffollowing on from last Thursday's
OL,14,Fgeneral election.
OL,16,FThe Speaker presides over sittings of
OL,17,Fthe House of Keys chamber and deputises
OL,18,Ffor the President of Tynwald when
OL,19,Fnecessary when the branches sit
OL,20,Ftogether each month.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
